mixdog-pdf-codec

The stream filters (FlateDecode, LZWDecode, ASCII85Decode, ASCIIHexDecode, RunLengthDecode and the TIFF and PNG
predictors) and the standard security handler (RC4, AES-128 and AES-256 decryption, the revision 2 to 6 key
derivation, the ISO 32000-2 password hash and the password checks) in this crate are ported from pdf.js 6.4.299
(src/core/flate_stream.js, lzw_stream.js, predictor_stream.js, ascii_85_stream.js, ascii_hex_stream.js,
run_length_stream.js, decrypt_stream.js, crypto.js, sasl_prep.js), including its tolerance of damaged data.

